/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#首先是代码","content":"首先是代码"},"11":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-6","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"其次就是服务器"},"12":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-7","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"配置 Pipeline 各阶段任务"},"13":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-8","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"阶段 1：打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库"},"14":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-9","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"阶段 2：部署到远程服务器"},"15":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-10","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#总结","content":"总结"},"16":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-11","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#为什么使用-azure-pipeline","content":"Azure Pipeline 是 Azure DevOps 提供的持续集成与持续部署（CI/CD）工具。使用它可以简化服务的打包与部署过程，免去手动操作服务器的麻烦，提升可维护性与可监控性。本文选择 Azure Pipeline 是因为公司正在评估 Azure DevOps 作为企业级 CI/CD 方案，同时 Azure DevOps 为个人用户提供了免费额度，非常适合入门与实验。"},"17":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-12","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#注册-azure-devops-账号","content":"azure devops 官网"},"18":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-13","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#注册-azure-devops-账号","content":"先在官网注册账号。注册账号之后，就需要创建组织了。"},"19":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-14","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#注册-azure-devops-账号","content":"组织创建完成之后，创建一个项目，就可以使用自己的devops了。"},"20":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-15","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"在azure devops里，可以直接不管敏捷开发那一套，直接来使用pipeline功能。"},"21":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-16","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"代码位置选择自己所用的代码仓库。"},"22":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-17","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"选择好代码仓库之后，就会让你选择具体的代码repository"},"23":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-18","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"azure会根据你的代码类型自动的创建一个pipeline的yaml文件。这个可以不用管。"},"24":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-19","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"到目前为止，你的yaml文件就创建好了。"},"25":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-20","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"刚开始创建的pipeline是根据项目语言自动识别的。到这里就需要更加的深入理解pipeline是什么了。\n首先，pipeline是一个流水线，也就是你的代码会经过一系列的步骤，然后才能部署到你的服务器。\npipeline的步骤可以分成三个部分："},"26":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-21","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"构建步骤：也就是你的代码编译打包，生成可执行的文件。"},"27":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-22","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"发布包到你的服务器，比如你的代码编译打包之后，生成了一个可执行的文件，但是这个文件需要部署到你的服务器上，才能被服务器部署。"},"28":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-23","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"远程执行服务器部署。"},"29":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-24","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"正常一个普通的项目就可以这么使用pipeline进行部署。说起来简单，但是部署的每个单元都需要准备好。"},"30":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-25","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#首先是代码","content":"为了能方便适应所有的环境，我决定使用docker来部署应用。那么，就需要给自己的项目配置dockerFile。\n并确保能正确的打出镜像，镜像可用。"},"31":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-26","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"服务器需要能接收到镜像，并且能正确部署。我们可以在打包的时候，把镜像文件保存起来直接传输到服务器上，\n然后在服务器上load这个镜像文件，再部署到服务器的容器了。这个方法是可行的，但其实比较繁琐。而且你每次构建的镜像\n并没有被保存起来，也不合适。生产的镜像最好有个归档。起码保存3个版本。所以，我决定使用docker hub来保存镜像。\n准备一个docker registry\ndocker hub虽然是可以用的，但是国内的网络环境访问还是很慢的。所以我这边直接使用了\n阿里云的容器仓库服务。\n注册一个阿里云容器仓库"},"32":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-27","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"阿里云的仓库可以免费使用3个命名空间，共计300个仓库。还是蛮划算的。指示流量有限制，具体可以看个人版的文档。"},"33":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-28","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"服务器配置有了阿里云镜像之后，就是要配置服务器的环境了。"},"34":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-29","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"安装一个docker的容器环境。"},"35":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-30","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"测试docker能否登陆阿里云的容器仓库。"},"36":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-31","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"尝试在本地项目打包镜像并上传到阿里云容器仓库，并在服务器下载镜像并部署。确实可以之后。就可以去pipeline\n完成这一整个链路了。这里还涉及到如何使用pass保存镜像仓库的密钥，避免密钥泄漏。还要通过GPG来加密密钥。后续再补充。"},"37":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-32","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"到目前为止，我们完成了基础的 YAML 文件配置。接下来我们将详细拆解每个阶段的配置细节。"},"38":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-33","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"yaml语法\npipeline的配置完全是通过yaml文件来完成的。所以需要线学习一个pipeline的yaml语法（这里假设你已经懂yaml本身的格式了）。\n跟jenkins的pipeline类似，azure的pipeline也是树形的结构。大致可以分为三层。"},"39":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-34","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"stages: stage是pipeline的最大执行单元，可以用与分割多个阶段的继承代码"},"40":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-35","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"jobs: job是stage的最小执行单元，可以包含多个tasks。一个stage可以有多个job。"},"41":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-36","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"task: task是job下的分支，一个job可以包含多个tasks，比较特殊的是，job下的task是通过steps来关联的。"},"42":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-37","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"service connection在pipeline中，需要使用service connection来连接你的服务器。包括ssh连接服务器，还有登陆阿里云镜像仓库来push镜像。\n创建一个镜像仓库的service connection。可以在项目设置里找到服务链接，创建一个 docker registry即可。"},"43":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-38","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"这是一个任务单元，使用的是azure pipeline预设的任务"},"44":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-39","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"command决定了这个预设任务做什么，\n这是约定好的值不能改，这个command就是构建docker镜像并发布到镜像仓库。"},"45":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-40","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"containerRegistry\n就是我们配置好的仓库的service connection名称。"},"46":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-41","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"repository就是我们push的镜像 命名空间/仓库名"},"47":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-42","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"Dockerfile就是我们项目里已经编写好的dockerfile文件。"},"48":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-43","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"这个任务就可以实现打包我们的项目镜像并发布到配置中心了"},"49":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-44","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"创建 ssh 链接托管（service connection）将服务务器部署到服务器上，需要用到ssh连接服务器。这里继续使用 azure 的 service connection 来创建\nssh 链接的托管。\n服务器准备好脚本在服务器上需要准备好需要的脚本，方便直接部署。 现在继续写 pipeline 的 stage2。"},"50":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-45","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"这里就直接看任务单元，\ntask:SSH@0 这也是预设的 pipeline 命令\n使用这个任务就可以借助配置好的 ssh 托管登录上远程服务器并执行命令。"},"51":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-46","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"sshEndpoint 就是我创建的 ecs ssh 托管"},"52":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-47","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"runOptions: 'inline' 是命令行的运行选项。总共可以设置三个，具体看 devops 文档。"},"53":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-48","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"inline：这就是 inline 模式下，把服务器脚本直接写在 pipeline 中。"},"54":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-49","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"从命令中可以看到我写的比较复杂，实际还用了环境变量，这块没有整理好，主要是为了保证\n密码安全。"},"55":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-50","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"按照上面的步骤，基本就完成了一个自己的可以运维的脚本配置了。"},"56":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-51","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#总结","content":"本文介绍了如何使用 Azure DevOps 构建一个完整的 CI/CD 流水线，涵盖项目打包、镜像构建、推送至镜像仓库，以及远程服务器部署的全过程。通过结合 Docker 与 Azure Pipeline 的服务连接配置，能够实现端到端的自动化部署。后续还可继续拓展如构建缓存、蓝绿部署、安全审计等功能，进一步提升部署效率与安全性。"},"57":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"page","content":"CDN 优化","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization"},"58":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-0","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","content":"优化阿里云的 CDN 流量"},"59":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-1","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#cdn-流量优化实战指南","content":"CDN 流量优化实战指南"},"60":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-2","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"1. 核心问题：为什么有 Etag 还有流量消耗？"},"61":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-3","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#2-最佳实践策略immutable-模式","content":"2. 最佳实践策略：Immutable 模式"},"62":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-4","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#3-阿里云-cdn-配置步骤","content":"3. 阿里云 CDN 配置步骤"},"63":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-5","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"3.1. 步骤一：配置客户端强缓存 (关键)"},"64":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-6","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"3.2. 步骤二：配置节点缓存 (省回源流量)"},"65":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-7","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#33-避坑设置","content":"3.3. 避坑设置"},"66":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-8","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"4. 验证方法 (Chrome Network)"},"67":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-9","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"5. 补充：防盗链"},"68":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-10","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#6-常见-faq","content":"6. 常见 FAQ"},"69":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-11","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"很多开发者认为有了 Etag (304 Not Modified) 就万事大吉了，但实际上："},"70":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-12","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"协商缓存 (Etag/304): 客户端每次都要发请求问服务器“变没变”。虽然不传图片内容，但会产生HTTP 请求头流量和CDN 请求次数费用。积少成多，流量依然可观。"},"71":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-13","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"强缓存 (Cache-Control): 客户端直接从本地磁盘/内存读取，完全不发起网络请求。流量消耗为 0。"},"72":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-14","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"目标： 将图片加载从“协商缓存”升级为“强缓存”。"},"73":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-15","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#2-最佳实践策略immutable-模式","content":"采用 “文件名/URL 变更即更新，内容不变则永久缓存” 的策略。"},"74":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-16","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#2-最佳实践策略immutable-模式","content":"配置目标： 让客户端缓存图片 1 年 (31536000秒)。"},"75":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-17","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#2-最佳实践策略immutable-模式","content":"更新机制： 如果图片内容需要修改，不要在原文件名上覆盖，而是修改文件名（如 banner-v1.jpg -> banner-v2.jpg）或 URL 参数。"},"76":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-18","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#3-阿里云-cdn-配置步骤","content":"入口： 阿里云 CDN 控制台 -> 域名管理 -> [目标域名] -> 缓存配置。"},"77":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-19","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"这是让小程序/浏览器不发请求的核心。"},"78":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-20","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"切换到 【修改出站响应头】 (HTTP Response Header) 标签页。"},"79":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-21","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"点击 添加。"},"80":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-22","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"配置如下："},"81":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-23","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"参数: Cache-Control"},"82":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-24","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"取值: max-age=31536000, immutable"},"83":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-25","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"策略: 拒绝 (或覆盖)"},"84":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-26","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"作用： 强制给所有响应加上缓存 1 年且不可变的指令。"},"85":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-27","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"关于 immutable: 这是一个高级指令，告诉客户端“这文件在过期前绝对不会变”，能进一步减少用户手动刷新页面时产生的 304 请求（iOS/Webkit 内核支持极佳）。"},"86":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-28","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"这是让 CDN 节点自己存住图片，少去 OSS 取货。"},"87":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-29","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"切换到 【缓存过期时间】 标签页。"},"88":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-30","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"添加规则："},"89":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-31","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"类型: 文件后缀"},"90":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-32","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"内容: jpg,jpeg,png,webp,gif"},"91":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-33","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"过期时间: 1 年"},"92":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-34","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"权重: 99"},"93":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-35","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#33-避坑设置","content":"客户端跟随 CDN 缓存策略： 建议 【关闭】。"},"94":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-36","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#33-避坑设置","content":"原因： 自动跟随往往很机械，无法添加 immutable 等高级指令。建议通过“修改出站响应头”来显式控制，逻辑更清晰。"},"95":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-37","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"不要直接按 F5 刷新验证！浏览器对 F5 有特殊处理。"},"96":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-38","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"正确验证步骤："},"97":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-39","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"打开开发者工具 -> Network。"},"98":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-40","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"取消勾选 Disable cache。"},"99":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-41","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"在地址栏输入图片 URL，按回车 (或在页面中点击链接跳转)。"},"100":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-42","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"观察结果："},"101":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-43","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"Status: 200 OK (from disk cache) 或 (from memory cache)。"},"102":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-44","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"Time: 0ms 或 1ms。"},"103":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-45","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"Response Headers: 点击请求查看，必须包含 Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable。"},"104":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-46","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"常见误区排查："},"105":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-47","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"现象： 状态是 200 (disk cache)，但 Header 里没有 Cache-Control。"},"106":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-48","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"原因： 浏览器读取的是配置生效前下载的旧缓存。"},"107":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-49","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"解决： 勾选 Disable cache 刷新一次（强行更新缓存），然后再取消勾选验证。"},"108":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-50","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"为了防止流量被盗用，建议配置 Referer 白名单。"},"109":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-51","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"微信小程序 Referer 格式：\nhttps://servicewechat.com/{appid}/{version}/page-frame.html"},"110":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-52","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"CDN 白名单推荐配置："},"111":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-53","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"servicewechat.com"},"112":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-54","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"*.servicewechat.com"},"113":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-55","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"注意： 开发工具中有时 Referer 包含 devtools，上述通配符已包含此情况。"},"114":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-56","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#6-常见-faq","content":"Q: 为什么我配置了 max-age，刷新页面还是 304？\nA: 浏览器的 F5/刷新按钮 会强制加上 Cache-Control: max-age=0，迫使浏览器向服务器发起协商验证。这是浏览器标准行为。正常用户点击进入页面时，是会走强缓存的。"},"115":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-57","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#6-常见-faq","content":"Q: 监控里有少量的 4xx 错误正常吗？\nA: 正常。通常是 404 (图片不存在) 或 403 (防盗链拦截)。只要业务显示正常，且 4xx 比例极低，属于互联网背景噪音，可忽略。"},"116":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-58","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#6-常见-faq","content":"Q: 图片刚上传，第一个访问的用户会回源吗？\nA: 会。第一个用户触发 CDN 回源拉取并缓存，后续用户（以及该用户后续的访问）将直接命中 CDN 或本地缓存。如果需要极致体验，可以使用 CDN 的 “预热” 功能。"},"117":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"page","content":"pingora 反向代理实战","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy"},"118":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-0","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","content":"学习使用 pingora 搭建一个反向代理"},"119":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-1","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#pingora-是什么","content":"pingora 是什么"},"120":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-2","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#快速上手-pingora","content":"快速上手 pingora"},"121":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-3","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#开搞代码","content":"开搞代码"},"122":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-4","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#热豆腐","content":"热豆腐"},"123":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-5","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"现在开始介绍一下搭建过程"},"124":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-6","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#pingora-是什么","content":"pingora 是 cloudflare 公司开源的一个代理框架，本意是为了弥补一些 nginx 的不足。\n我研究 pingora 的原因纯粹是想学习一下 rust，要说 pingora 能不能很好的替代 nginx，\n还得看大家的需求。"},"125":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-7","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#快速上手-pingora","content":"pingora源码官方地址pingora快速上手文档"},"126":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-8","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#快速上手-pingora","content":"从 pingora 的快速文档可以看出来 pingora 其实只是开源了一个可变成的 http 服务框架，\n有兴趣的朋友可以按照教程跑一下。我自己因为跑不通他们的 1.1.1.1 的服务器，所以没成功。\n但是他是自带了一个代理服务器需要的组件。所有的代码我还没有研究过，本文仅解释一下被用来\n实现反向代理的组件"},"127":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-9","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#热豆腐","content":"心急的朋友可以直接看下面是我搞得一个项目 demo项目源码位置可以根据 README 里的说明来实现一个反向代理"},"128":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-10","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"要实现反向代理，首先需要添加 pingora 的依赖，修改 cargo.toml\n添加"},"129":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-11","page_id":"